 "about_text": "Marshall Gallery is a Santa Monica photography gallery founded in 2018 by Douglas Marshall and opened to the public in 2021 at Bergamot Station Arts Center. The program centers on contemporary and 20th-century lens-based art, with particular attention to experimental processes, printmaking craft and conceptual approaches to photography and video. In recent years the roster has increasingly explored the intersection of photographic practice with painting and sculpture. Alongside a regular schedule of exhibitions, the gallery hosts artist conversations and community events and participates in art fairs internationally, positioning itself within ongoing conversations about photography's evolving role in contemporary art and collective memory.",
